# Only what the image needs goes into the build context. Everything else stays
# out, above all local secrets and per-machine state: cookies.txt (a logged-in
# session), the PO-token provider (.potoken), virtual environments and
# downloaded Python (.venv, .uv-python), uv.toml, .env, songs (input/, output/).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!README.md
!src
!tools

# never, not even inside the included folders
**/cookies.txt
**/.env

# python caches inside the included folders
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
